== cookie domains
   www.example.com Domain=example.com: accepted for example.com and its subdomains
   www.example.com Domain=.example.com: accepted for example.com and its subdomains
   www.example.com Domain=www.example.com: accepted for www.example.com
   www.example.com Domain=com: rejected: Domain is a public suffix
   www.example.co.uk Domain=co.uk: rejected: Domain is a public suffix
   www.example.co.uk Domain=example.co.uk: accepted for example.co.uk and its subdomains
   alice.github.io Domain=github.io: rejected: Domain is a public suffix
   alice.github.io Domain=alice.github.io: accepted for alice.github.io
   bob.github.io Domain=alice.github.io: rejected: Domain does not match the host
   shop.example.com Domain=other.com: rejected: Domain does not match the host
   shop.example.com Domain=ample.com: rejected: Domain does not match the host
   a.b.example.com Domain=b.example.com: accepted for b.example.com and its subdomains
   foo.city.kawasaki.jp Domain=city.kawasaki.jp: accepted for city.kawasaki.jp and its subdomains
   foo.bar.kawasaki.jp Domain=bar.kawasaki.jp: rejected: Domain is a public suffix
   x.y.bar.kawasaki.jp Domain=y.bar.kawasaki.jp: accepted for y.bar.kawasaki.jp and its subdomains
   app.herokuapp.com Domain=herokuapp.com: rejected: Domain is a public suffix
   www.EXAMPLE.com Domain=Example.COM: accepted for example.com and its subdomains
   1.2.3.4 Domain=1.2.3.4: accepted, host only
   1.2.3.4 Domain=2.3.4: rejected: the host is an IP address
   localhost Domain=localhost: accepted for localhost
   www.例子.中国 Domain=例子.中国: accepted for 例子.中国 and its subdomains
   www.例子.中国 Domain=中国: rejected: Domain is a public suffix
   www.xn--fiqs8s Domain=xn--fiqs8s: rejected: Domain is a public suffix
   bucket.s3.amazonaws.com Domain=s3.amazonaws.com: rejected: Domain is a public suffix
   a.www.ck Domain=www.ck: accepted for www.ck and its subdomains
   a.foo.ck Domain=foo.ck: rejected: Domain is a public suffix
     accepted: 13
     rejected: 13
== same site
   https://www.example.com/ and https://api.example.com/v1: same site, example.com
   https://alice.github.io/ and https://bob.github.io/: different sites, alice.github.io and bob.github.io
   https://example.co.uk/ and https://example.com/: different sites, example.co.uk and example.com
   https://a.example.co.uk and http://b.example.co.uk:8080: same site, example.co.uk
   https://foo.blogspot.com and https://bar.blogspot.com: different sites, foo.blogspot.com and bar.blogspot.com
   https://news.bbc.co.uk and https://www.bbc.com: different sites, bbc.co.uk and bbc.com
   http://1.2.3.4/ and http://1.2.3.4:81/: same site, 1.2.3.4
   https://localhost and https://localhost:3000: same site, localhost
   https://例子.中国/ and https://www.xn--fsqu00a.xn--fiqs8s/: different sites, 例子.中国 and xn--fsqu00a.xn--fiqs8s
   https://a.foo.ck and https://b.foo.ck: different sites, a.foo.ck and b.foo.ck
   https://www.ck and https://a.www.ck: same site, www.ck
   https://mail.google.com and https://accounts.google.com: same site, google.com
